---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy — MyToolMint" description="Current information about cookies and similar technologies on MyToolMint.">
  <LegalPage eyebrow="Cookies" title="Cookie Policy" intro="MyToolMint keeps tracking to a minimum and explains the technologies in use.">
    <section><h2>MyToolMint cookies</h2><p>MyToolMint does not currently set its own cookies for accounts, preferences, analytics or advertising. The Word Unscrambler keeps shareable search settings in the URL rather than a cookie.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Hosting technologies</h2><p>The current public preview is served through GitHub Pages. GitHub may use cookies or similar technologies to deliver, secure and operate its services. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-cookies">GitHub Cookies</a> for current details.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Analytics and advertising</h2><p>MyToolMint does not currently use Google Analytics, Google AdSense or another advertising or behavioural analytics service. There is therefore no MyToolMint analytics or advertising consent banner at this time.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Future changes</h2><p>If analytics, advertising or preference cookies are introduced, this policy and the privacy policy will be updated before activation. Appropriate notice and consent controls will be added where required.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Your browser controls</h2><p>You can inspect, block or delete cookies through your browser settings. Blocking technologies needed by a hosting provider can affect how a website loads or operates.</p></section>
  </LegalPage>
</BaseLayout>
